	quests: [{
		description: [
			"&nWelcome to Create: Forge Frontier!&r"
			""
			"Step into a world shaped by creativity, engineering, and discovery. &6Create: Forge Frontier&r invites you to explore vast landscapes, design intricate machines, master unique recipes, and uncover countless adventures along the way."
			""
			"The heart of your journey is the &3Create&r mod, a toolkit of mechanical ingenuity. From gears and shafts to precision-built machinery, Create empowers you to build functional factories, elegant contraptions, and inspired works of automation. What you create here is limited only by your imagination."
			""
			"{@pagebreak}"
			"This modpack features extensive custom content and carefully balanced progression to ensure every mechanic feels at home within the &3Create&r ecosystem. Recipes, resources, and systems have been reshaped to create a seamless flow, from your first materials to your most advanced engineering feats. Every step is designed to feel purposeful, rewarding, and aligned with the world around you."
			""
			"As you explore, you may notice that quests continue to grow and evolve. Our small but dedicated development team is hard at work expanding the Forge Frontier experience. Your patience and feedback help shape the journey, and we are grateful to build this world alongside you."
			""
			"So, prepare your tools and spark your imagination. The &6Forge Frontier&r awaits with wonders to discover, machines to build, meals to craft, and stories to uncover."
			""
			"{@pagebreak}"
			"If you need support or want to meet fellow explorers, join our community on &1Discord&r by clicking the image below this quest!"
			""
			"{@pagebreak}"
			"&nMeet the Forge Frontier Dev Team&r"
			""
			"- &eM0nkeyPr0grammer&r – &lLead Developer and Visionary&r"
			"- &eGamma02&r – &lFeature Engineer and Systems Integrator&r"
			"- &eCtrlAltDyleted&r – &lOld Quest Architect&r"
			"- &eThunderkeeper&r – &lQuest Architect and Wiki Specialist&r"
			"- &eSSZNBEATS&r – &lMusic Composer and Soundtrack Producer&r  "
			""
			"Together, we are building a frontier where creativity, exploration, and imagination thrive. Thank you for embarking on this journey with us!"
		]
